==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Coco (Enemy)|Coco]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

